{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to save this decaying world! Glory, riches, adventures, and the sweet bodies of your workers await you!<br><br>The Goddess chose you, a successful businessman, to rebuild an abandoned village in another world (you didn\u2019t really get a say in it). Now you need to boost the economy, hire hotties, and figure out what threat looms over this world.<br><br><strong>Get Stronger Through Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/e06e0252e8b0b174cb525302e1cde299.poster.avif?t=1774497692\" width=780 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/e06e0252e8b0b174cb525302e1cde299.webm?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/e06e0252e8b0b174cb525302e1cde299.mp4?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't develop the village without cleaning out nearby monsters! Assemble your heroic party, equip and train them to emerge victorious on their own in battles ahead.<br><br><strong>Hire Workers</strong><br><br><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/5dde84c88a1e9c7a3f41fc78c4a738d6.poster.avif?t=1774497692\" width=780 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/5dde84c88a1e9c7a3f41fc78c4a738d6.webm?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/5dde84c88a1e9c7a3f41fc78c4a738d6.mp4?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Gorgeous fantasy babes want to work and are ready to do anything for their \u201cboss\u201d! Get to know them better during walks or even take your relationships to full-on dates (with stunning animated scenes)!<br><strong>Develop the Village</strong><br><br><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/302c57ba2f6051f38d35af98db0e3c27.poster.avif?t=1774497692\" width=780 height=678 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/302c57ba2f6051f38d35af98db0e3c27.webm?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/302c57ba2f6051f38d35af98db0e3c27.mp4?t=1774497692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>This place has the potential to become a luxurious resort or the industrial capital of the world, if you put in the effort. Or maybe you\u2019d rather train successful adventurers? It\u2019s up to you to decide how to develop the village!<br><br><strong>Collect Pets</strong><br><br>Under every bush and in every cave, there\u2019s some weird critter hiding. Train them, level up their skills, and put them to use! Or just show them off. They\u2019re so damn cute! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850550/extras/304a9b3030f81efeecbafe9be7bdfc84.avif?t=1774497692\" width=616 height=343 /></span><br><br><strong>Level Up Skills </strong><br><br>Being the Goddess\u2019s apostle isn\u2019t just an honor! She\u2019s ready to reward you for your achievements. Get better, work faster, add a few inches to\u2026 well, you\u2019re probably good there already.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850550?t=1774497692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.